# MCP Compose

Plan a tool chain using the `mcp-tool-composer` skill.

## Skill Loaded
**Required:** Read `skills/mcp-tool-composer/SKILL.md` and `commands/mcp-compose.md`.

## Usage
```
/mcp-compose create stories from the requirements doc and attach them to the epic
```

## Output
The chain — step, tool, purpose, budget, fallback — and the MCP surface cost against
the ceiling.

## Notes
Plans, does not execute. Never invents a tool name; composes from the registry.
